## iboxpromote example

edit and create these to test iboxpromote controller logic

The iboxreplica fields are as follows:
- description: this field can be a user defined description
- entity_type: this field can be "SNAPSHOT" or "KUBE_SNAPSHOT"
- entity_name: this field is the name of an ibox snapshot when 'entity_type' is set to SNAPSHOT, or a Kube VolumeSnapshot name when 'entity_type' is set to KUBE_SNAPSHOT
- base_action: set to "NEW"
